# Vivado batch-build output dirs (large generated project files).
# Keep the .rpt reports (they're the area/timing evidence), drop the generated
# project. Note: this must be `vivado_regfile/*` + a negation, NOT
# `vivado_regfile/` — git cannot re-include a file under a directory excluded
# wholesale, so `!vivado_regfile/*.rpt` only works with `/*` above it.
vivado_regfile/*
!vivado_regfile/*.rpt
vivado_cpu/
vivado_bringup/
*.bit

# Standalone embedded repos (own git history; not part of this repo, not pushed here)
/MeshStat/
/projects/AMD_L1_Cache_DV/

# Résumés — kept locally for review only, never displayed on GitHub
*resume*.pdf
*Resume*.pdf

# Windows "downloaded-from-internet" metadata streams
*Zone.Identifier

